Message-ID: <839691711003171759mf429a48r3d9f91c773f7abb4@mail.gmail.com>

Hi Sivan,

I think they problem is that you may have most likely set the the
polynomials of time to intersect with the cross-section. Unfortunately
this adds many parameters to the model (2 for each cross-section
unit). If you uncheck this box (in the TSCS menu), then it should run.

Cheers,
matt.

